cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SynthScope in your research, please cite it."
title: "SynthScope: A Unified Library and Benchmark for AI-Generated Image and Video Detection"
abstract: >-
  SynthScope re-implements a range of state-of-the-art AI-generated (synthetic) image and video
  detectors behind a single configuration system, training loop, datasets, transforms, and
  metrics, so that different methods can be trained and benchmarked under identical conditions,
  with results reported per generator/source.
type: software
